| Condition | Requirement | Candidate Item(s) | Satisfying Candidate |
|-----------|-------------|-------------------|----------------------|
| A | ≥10 board-certified compliance officers | `e_000698` (12 board-certified compliance officers) | `e_000698` |
| B | Quarterly clinical error rate < 2.0% | `e_00dfb2` (clinical error rate of 1.2% last quarter) | `e_00dfb2` |
| C | Active ISO 27001 data protection certificate | `e_0041f5` (active ISO 27001 certificate) | `e_0041f5` |

If a condition cannot be satisfied, we use `null`. All conditions above have satisfying candidates.

